  [1mMinor[0m

  [38;5;153mparseOrderId[39m accepts a single-element array (regex coerces to string and the function returns the input unnormalized);
  [38;5;153mcreatedAt[39m is client-controlled while the purpose-built [38;5;153mnowIso(clock)[39m sits unused; duplicate order ids are accepted;
  [38;5;153msrc/config.js[39m parses [38;5;153mconfig.json[39m at module scope with no try/catch and no schema check (a missing [38;5;153mpageSize[39m makes every
